  "description": "Operating Area: Sardinia, Italy\n\nTINE IV is a 24.50m / 80ft Luxury Motor Superyacht built in 2012 by Pershing and later underwent a refit in 2026. Sleeping 6 guests in 3 cabins and with a crew of 3. Cruising at 30.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 47.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise of a Master Cabin with king size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities, a VIP cabin with double bed and en-suite bathroom facilities, and a twin cabin with en-suite bathroom facilities.",
